  "body": "Current amendment head **f9ac293926d8f5787056b42543b4c116dd57c540**, retained developer Sindri(worker-3): F1 terminology correction compiled clean and published for verification. Full suite/UI/MCP, fresh Claude/Grok checks and main-conflict scope disposition remain pending. See the single [Current state](https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-orchestrator/pull/119#issuecomment-6365106078) for exact-tip evidence and acceptance.\n\nFixes #118.\n\nThe credit-control help used `@_current.fields.No_`, so its check sent literal token text and the playbook completed without the intended write. The example now uses `@_current.primaryKey.No_` throughout, including its base64 template. Verify warns when a primary-key field is read under `fields`, and the runner fails unresolved requests before dispatch in single, forEach and paged steps. Existing resolver signatures remain intact.\n\nIncludes bilingual diagnostics/XLF and regression coverage. Existing test naming, declaration-order and format-string warnings were repaired without weakening assertions. No pipeline changes or new suppressions.\n\nDeveloper verification at **dd6d86cac9e8f9b068fd68b30009c04ed8cf610a**:\n- Product CodeCop/UICop/AppSourceCop and test CodeCop/UICop: **0 errors, 0 warnings**. AppSourceCop compatibility against current main also passes.\n- Full configured ORCHESTRAT suite: **437 executed, 437 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped**, including all 9 new #118 tests.\n- Self-seeded live MCP: **18 passed, 0 failed/skipped**, LCIDs1033/1039; Verify, Run, Schedule warning gate and Help overview. Real guarded writes use only own target headers.\n- Actual BC Web Client: **4 passed, 0 failed/skipped**, en-US/is-IS Run Now failure/success and own-target readback; original language restored.\n- Owned COSMO `worker4-orch118-20261023` / `f0223a373d54`: Orchestrator28.0.2.0, Foundation28.0.9.618 from green main; no-IVT Default then Test product/test on the same container. Cleanup **DELETE204 / GET404** verified.\n\n[Per-issue acceptance matrix and retained evidence](https://github.com/businesscentralal/bc-origo-bifrost-orchestrator/blob/6930b261f8827f80729bceda586d52ffa6bc850b/verification/dd6d86cac9e8f9b068fd68b30009c04ed8cf610a/acceptance-matrix.json). The packet retains setup/harness failures and corrections. Standard Some Fields audit setup kept the Blocked guard; no force, guard exception, licence, consent or backend-state writes. The advisory gateway's raw findings and developer dispositions are included; no confirmed blocking source finding.\n\nIndependent current-head Claude verification on bc28-w1, PR CI (including normal signed Default), Grok exact-tip clearance, eligible non-author approval and Architect merge/deploy remain pending. Tester UAT and actual closure evidence stay tracked after merge; this PR is not delivery or UAT clearance. Original source/checkpoints: Alvíss (worker-4), preserved. Current retained developer: Sindri (worker-3).",
